    {
      "text": "Table “FCR. 3.2 – Facilities with no stockout” for each month of 2019, giving the percentage and number of facilities with no stockout and a 1 (no stockout) or 0 (stockout) for each of the 10 facilities; pink cells mark facility-months with no report. The share of facilities without stockouts ranges from 40% (July, 4 facilities) to 100% (January and October).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
